{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "dragon-market-api",
    "name": "Dragon Market",
    "description": "Dragon Market API — secure marketplace for Guilds (Common/Rare limit orders + Legendary auctions).\n\n**Auth (writes):** `X-Guild-ID` header\n**Idempotency:** optional `Idempotency-Key` on POST writes\n\n**Dev guild IDs (seed):**\n- Iron Vanguard: `11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111`\n- Shadow Syndicate: `22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222`\n- Crystal Forge: `33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "guildId",
      "value": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
    },
    {
      "key": "sellerGuildId",
      "value": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
    },
    {
      "key": "itemId",
      "value": "a3000003-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
    },
    {
      "key": "auctionId",
      "value": "b3000003-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
    },
    {
      "key": "bidId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Liveness probe."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Items",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Items",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/items",
            "description": "List all items with oracle reference prices when available."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/items/{{itemId}}",
            "description": "Get item details by ID.\n\n**Seed legendary:** Soul Reaver `a3000003-0000-4000-8000-000000000001`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Item (Common)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Guild-ID",
                "value": "{{guildId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Healing Draught\",\n  \"item_type\": \"common\",\n  \"list_price\": 500\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/items",
            "description": "Register a Common/Rare item for fixed-price sale.\n\n`item_type`: `common` | `rare` | `legendary`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Item (Legendary → Auction)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Guild-ID",
                "value": "{{sellerGuildId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Stormbreaker Axe\",\n  \"item_type\": \"legendary\",\n  \"list_price\": 600000\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/items",
            "description": "Legendary items start an active auction automatically. Name must be globally unique among legendaries."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bidding",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Place Bid",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('bidId', body.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Guild-ID",
                "value": "{{guildId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 500000\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/items/{{itemId}}/bid",
            "description": "Place a bid on the active auction for a Legendary item.\n\nRules:\n- Cannot bid on own item\n- First bid ≥ starting price\n- Subsequent bids ≥ 5% above current highest\n- Funds are reserved (not debited)\n\n**Soul Reaver** starting price: 500,000 (seller: Shadow Syndicate — use Iron Vanguard or Crystal Forge as bidder)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Place Bid (Outbid)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Guild-ID",
                "value": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 525000\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/items/{{itemId}}/bid",
            "description": "Example outbid: 5% above 500,000 = 525,000 minimum."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Withdraw Bid",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Guild-ID",
                "value": "{{guildId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/items/{{itemId}}/bid/{{bidId}}",
            "description": "Withdraw a bid. Only allowed if the bidder is **not** the current highest bidder."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auctions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Active Auctions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auctions",
            "description": "List all active auctions."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Auction",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auctions/{{auctionId}}",
            "description": "Get auction details including bids.\n\n**Seed:** Soul Reaver auction `b3000003-0000-4000-8000-000000000001`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Guild / Wallet",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Wallet — Iron Vanguard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/guilds/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/wallet",
            "description": "Wallet balance, reserved funds, and daily spend cap."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Wallet — Shadow Syndicate",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/guilds/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/wallet"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Wallet — Crystal Forge",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/guilds/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333/wallet"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Wallet (variable)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/guilds/{{guildId}}/wallet"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
